{
  "title": "Lightly Crunchy Canadian Chickpeas Flatbread",
  "description": "A winey, crunchy, midnight-craving Canadian dish featuring hummus and double-rise-bread, perfect for a plant-based friendly snack. It is cooked on a tava griddle to give it a crispy texture.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
